---
---
<section class="mt-4.5 bg-[#0a0912]/90 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-md p-5 sm:p-7" id="skills" aria-label="Skills">
  <div class="flex justify-between items-end gap-4 flex-wrap mb-5">
    <div>
      <div class="font-mono-code text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase text-[#ffb347]">
        <span class="i18n-en">Toolbox</span>
        <span class="i18n-th">คลังเครื่องมือ</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight mt-1.5 text-white">
        <span class="i18n-en">Skills</span>
        <span class="i18n-th">ทักษะ</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-[#c9c2dc] max-w-[520px] m-0">
      <span class="i18n-en">Grouped by evidence from real repos — no padding. If it’s listed, there’s a project behind it.</span>
      <span class="i18n-th">จัดกลุ่มตามโค้ดและโปรเจกต์ที่ใช้งานจริง ทุกทักษะที่ระบุมีผลงานรองรับจริง</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
    <!-- Languages -->
    <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5 bg-white/[0.03]">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-start gap-2.5 mb-3">
        <h3 class="font-mono-code text-xs sm:text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white m-0">
          <span class="i18n-en">Languages</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">ภาษาเขียนโปรแกรม</span>
        </h3>
        <span class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center justify-start sm:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=ts" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=js" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=java" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=cs" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=dotnet" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=mysql" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=html" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=css" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Java</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">C# (.NET 10)</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">SQL</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">HTML</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">CSS</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Frontend -->
    <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5 bg-white/[0.03]">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-start gap-2.5 mb-3">
        <h3 class="font-mono-code text-xs sm:text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white m-0">
          <span class="i18n-en">Frontend</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">ส่วนหน้า (Frontend)</span>
        </h3>
        <span class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center justify-start sm:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=react" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=nextjs" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=cloudflare" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=vite" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=tailwind" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=dotnet" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=astro" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=bootstrap" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="bg-white h-6 w-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md shrink-0">
            <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/shadcn-ui.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-4 h-4 opacity-95" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">React</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Next.js</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Vinext</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Vite</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Tailwind CSS</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">ASP.NET Core MVC</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Astro</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Bootstrap</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Shadcn-ui</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Backend -->
    <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5 bg-white/[0.03]">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-start gap-2.5 mb-3">
        <h3 class="font-mono-code text-xs sm:text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white m-0">
          <span class="i18n-en">Backend</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">ส่วนหลังบ้าน</span>
        </h3>
        <span class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center justify-start sm:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=nodejs" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=express" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/hono.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 bg-[#242836] rounded-md shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=postman" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Node.js</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Express</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Hono</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Postman</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Data -->
    <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5 bg-white/[0.03]">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-start gap-2.5 mb-3">
        <h3 class="font-mono-code text-xs sm:text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white m-0">
          <span class="i18n-en">Data</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">ข้อมูล</span>
        </h3>
        <span class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center justify-start sm:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=mysql" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=postgres" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=sqlite" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="bg-[#242836] h-6 w-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md shrink-0">
            <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/neon-icon.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-4 h-4 opacity-95" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=prisma" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="bg-white h-6 w-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md shrink-0">
            <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/drizzle-orm.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-4 h-4 opacity-95" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=redis" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="bg-[#242836] h-6 w-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md shrink-0">
            <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/upstash-icon.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-4 h-4 opacity-95" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=supabase" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">MySQL</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">SQLite</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Neon</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Prisma ORM</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Drizzle ORM</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Redis</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Upstash</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Supabase</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Cloud, DevOps & Edge -->
    <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5 bg-white/[0.03]">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-start gap-2.5 mb-3">
        <h3 class="font-mono-code text-xs sm:text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white m-0">
          <span class="i18n-en">Cloud, DevOps &amp; Edge</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">คลาวด์, DevOps &amp; เอดจ์</span>
        </h3>
        <span class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center justify-start sm:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=cloudflare" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=workers" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=vercel" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=docker" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="bg-[#242836] h-6 w-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md shrink-0">
            <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/nginx.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=bash" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Cloudflare</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Workers</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Vercel</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Docker</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Nginx</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Bash</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- AI & Assistants -->
    <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5 bg-white/[0.03]">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-start gap-2.5 mb-3">
        <h3 class="font-mono-code text-xs sm:text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white m-0">
          <span class="i18n-en">AI &amp; Assistants</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">ปัญญาประดิษฐ์ &amp; ผู้ช่วย (AI)</span>
        </h3>
        <span class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center justify-start sm:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="bg-white h-6 w-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md shrink-0">
            <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/claude-icon.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-4 h-4 opacity-95" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/claude-code.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="bg-white h-6 w-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md shrink-0">
            <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/google-gemini.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-4 h-4 opacity-95" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white h-6 w-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md shrink-0">
            <img src="https://devicons.io/devicons/icons/github-copilot.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-4 h-4 opacity-95" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Claude</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Claude Code</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">Gemini</span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-[12.5px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/25 text-[#efeaff] hover:border-white/35 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">GitHub Copilot</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Tools, Editor & Package Managers -->
    <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5 bg-white/[0.03]">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-start gap-2.5 mb-3">
        <h3 class="font-mono-code text-xs sm:text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white m-0">
          <span class="i18n-en">Tools &amp; Package Managers</span>
          <span class="i18n-th">เครื่องมือ &amp; แพ็กเกจแมนเนเจอร์</span>
        </h3>
        <span class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center justify-start sm:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=git" alt="" width="26" height="26" class="w-6 h-6 opacity-95 shrink-0" loading="lazy" />
